    "category": "Ready-to-drink protein shake",
    "description": "The bottled AMP Wheybolic 40 is one of the higher-protein ready-to-drink shakes on the market. Per GNC's listing at the time of writing, each bottle gives 40 g of protein, about 190 calories, 1.5 g of fat, 6 g of carbohydrate and 1 g of sugar, sold in 4-packs and 12-packs. That beats the 20 to 30 g most bottled shakes provide. Like every ready-to-drink shake, it costs more per gram than powder, so use it for convenience rather than as your main protein.",
    "pros": [
      "40 g of protein per bottle (per GNC's listing)",
