    }
  },
  {
    "id": "dymatize-iso100-hydrolyzed",
    "name": "Dymatize ISO100 Hydrolyzed Whey Isolate",
    "brand": "Dymatize",
    "badge": "Alternative: Certified Isolate",
    "category": "Hydrolyzed whey protein isolate",
    "description": "ISO100 is the alternative for lactose-sensitive buyers and drug-tested athletes. Per the label at the time of writing it gives about 25 g of protein in roughly 120 calories per scoop with about 1 g of sugar, from hydrolyzed whey isolate and whey isolate, and Dymatize states it carries Informed Choice certification. Isolate is filtered to remove most lactose, so it is the safer pick for people who get bloated on blends. It usually costs a little more per gram than Gold Standard.",
    "pros": [
      "About 25 g of protein per scoop (label)",
