      "Isolate, lower in lactose"
    ],
    "cons": [
      "Costs a little more per gram than Gold Standard",
      "Thinner texture than a blend"
    ],
    "bottomLine": "The pick over GNC if you need certification or have trouble with lactose.",
    "specs": {
      "Protein per serving": "About 25 g (label)",
      "Calories": "About 120",
      "Third-party testing": "Informed Choice (brand)",
      "Best for": "Tested athletes, lactose-sensitive"
